        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Impact Report 2025"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Since 2022 we have served 77,300 meals and given 1,012 medical visits to children. Read our full 2025 Impact Report, including financials and team."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698bf485adc9f899a2b31351/6aabe3010b2a2bd6e7cd0852_6aabe16394786ad4c9e83718_VVF_FinancialsCover_Quarterly_Featured_v1.png",
          "alt": "Your Impact 1Q2025"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Your Impact 1Q2025"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "In the first quarter of 2025 we served over 6,367 meals and gave medical attention to over 110 children. Read the full quarterly update."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698bf485adc9f899a2b31351/6aabe3010b2a2bd6e7cd0852_6aabe16394786ad4c9e83718_VVF_FinancialsCover_Quarterly_Featured_v1.png",
          "alt": "Your Impact 3Q2024"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Your Impact 3Q2024"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "By the third quarter of 2024 we had served 16,797 meals, given medical attention to 350 children and launched an education program."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698bf485adc9f899a2b31351/6aabe3010b2a2bd6e7cd0852_6aabe16394786ad4c9e83718_VVF_FinancialsCover_Quarterly_Featured_v1.png",
          "alt": "Your Impact 2Q2024"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Your Impact 2Q2024"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "By the second quarter of 2024 we had served 10,547 meals and given medical attention to over 300 children. Read the full quarterly update."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/698bf485adc9f899a2b31351/6aabe3010b2a2bd6e7cd0852_6aabe16394786ad4c9e83718_VVF_FinancialsCover_Quarterly_Featured_v1.png",
